  "notes": [
    "Each branch records the nearest flag-setting compare/mask in the eight instructions before it.",
    "The two CTR branches are the 45-dword matrix copies.",
    "`operand`/`operands` name the last load, immediate, mask, indexed load or call result that fed the tested register; float provenance is the nearest load, not the whole expression.",
    "`category_dispatch` decodes 80030490: 48 category bytes index a 15-entry handler table; bit 0x80 swaps the two arguments. The call site passes (slot << 3) | record+0x58, not a constant.",
    "Named gates and the pair validity rules are documented separately."
